    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy are delighted to present No. 8 Dun Emer Close to the market—an excellent three-bedroom family home ideally positioned in a quiet and highly sought-after cul-de-sac.\n\nThis attractive property offers well-balanced and spacious accommodation, complemented by a range of desirable features including generously sized bedrooms, a main bedroom with en-suite, guest WC, and a spacious rear garden—perfect for family living and outdoor enjoyment.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a bright and welcoming entrance hallway, guest WC, a large living room that flows seamlessly into the dining area, and an open-plan kitchen/dining room with direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes, including a main bedroom with en-suite, along with a modern family bathroom.\n\nNo. 8 is ideally located within the popular Dun Emer development, which benefits from its own shop, gym, and crèche—adding great convenience for residents. The property is just a short stroll from Lusk Village, where a wide range of amenities and services are readily available.\n\nLusk is a charming and well-connected village, ideally situated close to Skerries and Rush, and within easy commuting distance of Dublin Airport, the M1, M50, and Dublin City Centre. The area is renowned for its strong sense of community, excellent primary and secondary schools, and a wide selection of sporting and recreational facilities—making it an ideal location for families."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWood floor, coving, under stairs storage\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled floor, WC, WHB, tiled splashback, fan\n\nLiving Room - \nWood floor, coving, feature fireplace, double doors to dining room\n\nKitchen Dining Room - \nTiled floor to kitchen, fitted kitchen with wall and floor mounted units, tiled splashback, integrated oven and hob, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, wood floor to dining room to sunroom, French door to garden\n\nLanding - \nCarpet to floor, hotpress, veulx window\n\nMain Bedroom - \nWood floor, spacious double room, built in wardrobes\n\nEn-suite - \nTiled floor, WC, WHB with tiled splashback, shower unit with fully tiled walls, fan\n\nBedroom 2 - \nWood floor, spacious double room, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - \nWood floor, single room, over looking front\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled walls and floor, WC, WHB, bath, separate shower unit, window\n\nRear Garden - \nLarge spacious garden, mainly in lawn\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
