        "Content": "<ul><li> Cul-de-Sac Location</li><li> G.F.C.H.</li><li> Double Glazed Windows Throughout</li><li> Guest WC</li><li> Main Bedroom En-suite</li><li> Large Rear Garden</ul>"
      },
